      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Show how OCI Observability services interlock with IAM and governance to monitor access, capture audit trails, detect policy changes, track tenancy structure, govern compartments, alert on risk, support compliance evidence, and improve cloud operating-model maturity.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
